cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or results, please cite it as below."
title: "High-Precision Null: Mandatory E-Procurement Disclosure and Market Competition"
abstract: >-
  Three pre-registered quasi-experimental studies (staggered-adoption group-time
  ATT, contract-level fixed effects, and a legal threshold regression
  discontinuity) on 6.78 million EU TED contract award notices, converging on a
  high-precision null for the effect of mandatory e-procurement disclosure on
  market competition, with one surviving mechanism finding on SME participation.
authors:
  - name: "NEO Research Program"
